%% Demo for the Mermaid import (0.27.2): import it into the draft hld-import of sase-hld.
%% Description: The agent asks the nearest POP for a tunnel; the POP checks the device and the policy before it says yes.
sequenceDiagram
    title Agent opens a tunnel (from Mermaid)
    actor Agent
    participant P as pop-edge
    participant A as AuthService
    participant U as users svc
    participant C as cp-middlewre
    participant PE as policy-engine
    participant R as risk-scorer
    participant L as audit-log-svc
    Agent->>P: POST /tunnels: the agent asks for a tunnel
    P->>A: POST /token
    A-->>P: token
    Note over P,A: the edge swaps the device token for a session token
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        P->>U: GET /users/{id}/posture
        P->>C: PUT /devices/{deviceId}/sync
    end
    P->>PE: Evaluate
    PE->>R: Score: how risky the device is
    P->>L: POST /events
    P-->>Agent: tunnel ready
